resolution: "Implemented daily/manual eligibility checks, calendar versioning, protected PAT push, idempotent npm provenance publishing, and exact npm/npx/bunx verification."
expected_result: Meaningful changes create one validated tag and one npm artifact usable by npm and Bun; skips and retries are safe.
