comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:24:36.247Z",codex-root,Work is governed by the lossless changelog and exact-version publishing acceptance gates.
  "2026-07-21T17:40:52.503Z",codex-root,"Implemented daily/manual Auto Release, protected PAT push, tag-triggered idempotent npm provenance publishing, and exact npm/npx/bunx verification."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:24:36.247Z",codex-root,Publish once to npm and verify the same package through both npm and Bun consumers.
  "2026-07-21T17:40:52.503Z",codex-root,Bun uses the npm registry; the workflow publishes once and verifies both consumer toolchains.
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:24:36.247Z",codex-root,GitHub tag pushes made with GITHUB_TOKEN do not trigger downstream push workflows; production uses RELEASE_PAT.
  "2026-07-21T17:40:52.503Z",codex-root,Pipeline outputs must explicitly distinguish skips from new tags so a no-op run never waits on an old release workflow.
